('112.6.b.8.C',3,'Which parts are needed to make a bulb light?','["a battery, wires, and a bulb", "a magnet and a rock", "paper and tape only", "a spoon and a cup"]'::jsonb,0,'The battery supplies energy, the wires carry it, and the bulb uses it.','original'),
('112.6.b.8.C',3,'A switch is turned on and the light turns on. What did the switch do?','["opened the circuit", "closed the circuit", "cooled the wire", "removed the battery"]'::jsonb,1,'A closed switch completes the path.','original'),
