('112.6.b.8.C',3,'Electrical energy changes into which two forms in a toaster?','["water and soil", "cold and dark", "sound and wind", "heat and light"]'::jsonb,3,'A toaster glows and gets hot.','original'),
('112.6.b.8.C',4,'A student draws a loop with a battery, a bulb, and wires with no gaps. What will happen?','["the bulb will light", "the bulb will stay off", "the battery will freeze", "the wire will turn to water"]'::jsonb,0,'A closed loop lets the current flow.','original'),
('112.6.b.9.A',2,'Which season has the longest daylight hours in Texas?','["spring", "summer", "fall", "winter"]'::jsonb,1,'Summer days are longest.','original'),
