('112.6.b.10.A',3,'Rain runs into a stream that flows to the ocean. What is the rain doing?','["moving across Earth''s surface", "turning to ice", "leaving Earth", "turning to rock"]'::jsonb,0,'Runoff carries water over land.','original'),
('112.6.b.10.A',4,'On a hot, sunny day, a puddle disappears. Where did the water go?','["into the Sun", "into the air as water vapor", "into outer space only", "into the ground as rock"]'::jsonb,1,'Heat evaporates the water into the air.','original'),
('112.6.b.10.B',2,'What is weathering?','["the dropping of sand in a new place", "the growing of mountains", "the breaking down of rock into smaller pieces", "the moving of sand by wind"]'::jsonb,2,'Weathering breaks rock apart.','original'),
