('112.6.b.11.C',4,'A student pours water on three rocks. One soaks water in quickly, one keeps water on top, and one soaks it in slowly. Which rock is best for storing water?','["the rock with the most pore space", "the rock with no spaces at all", "none of them", "the rock that keeps water on top"]'::jsonb,0,'Water soaking in quickly shows many pores.','original'),
